@startuml
title Alert Notifier State Machine

[*] --> Initializing
Initializing : initialize component to detect updates upon initial loading
Initializing --> Waiting : initialization successful
Initializing --> Unloading : initialization fails or system shutdown

Waiting : continuously check for incoming updates
Waiting --> ProcessingUpdate : detected update found
ProcessingUpdate : process detected updates by storing them and evaluating their significance
ProcessingUpdate --> NotifyingOperators : evaluation results meet certain conditions
ProcessingUpdate --> Waiting : no changes to notify
ProcessingUpdate --> Unloading : system shutdown during processing

Unloading : perform necessary cleanup operations
Unloading --> InformingComponentManager : successful removal during unloading
Unloading --> Terminating : component terminated after unloading is complete

Waiting --> ReturningToWaiting : after processing an update
@enduml
